  "kind": "recipe",
  "metadata": {
    "alignment": "unspecified",
    "description": "Creator fast-160k profile with TensorFold 757a851a, b12x b58f34ea, SAGE EXL3 cc64e77b and DFlash2 425aa615. TP4, BF16 latent KV, DCP1, 163,840-token context and seven-token DFlash at confidence 0.60. Original BF16 head bytes are extracted offline from the exact 5.36 GB source shard and verified before atomic cache publication; the corrected template and model index live in a separate cache view. Preserves creator tile pinning, RoCE equality checks, startup/per-request consensus, poisoned-rank exits and warm-up. Controller owns placement, exposure and lifecycle. The 126 GB per-node peak is estimated from upstream capacity observations; physical four-Spark acceptance is unverified.",
    "tags": [
      "glm",
      "tensorfold",
      "exl3",
      "dflash2",
      "reasoning",
      "tool-use",
      "spark"
    ],
    "title": "GLM-5.3 EXL3 3.38bpw TensorFold four Spark (vcruz305)"
